{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":11,"ref":"jeremiah 16:11","book":"jeremiah","lang":"yo","chapter":16,"translation":"Ìwọ sì yóò wí fún wọn pé: Nítorí tí àwọn baba yín fi ⟨את⟩mi sílẹ̀ — ìṣe Yahweh — wọ́n sì tẹ̀lé àwọn Elohim míràn, wọ́n sì ṣe ìjọsìn fún wọn, wọ́n sì forí balẹ̀ fún wọn; wọ́n sì fi ⟨את⟩mi sílẹ̀, wọn kò sì pa ⟨את⟩ òfin mi mọ́.","tokens":[{"surface":"ואמרת","gloss":"Ìwọ sì wí"},{"surface":"אליהם","gloss":"fún wọn"},{"surface":"על","gloss":"Nítorí"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"tí"},{"surface":"עזבו","gloss":"fi sílẹ̀"},{"surface":"אבותיכם","gloss":"àwọn baba yín"},{"surface":"אותי","gloss":"⟨את⟩mi"},{"surface":"נאם","gloss":"ìṣe"},{"surface":"יהוה","gloss":"Yahweh"},{"surface":"וילכו","gloss":"wọ́n sì tẹ̀lé"},{"surface":"אחרי","gloss":"lẹ́yìn"},{"surface":"אלהים","gloss":"Elohim"},{"surface":"אחרים","gloss":"míràn"},{"surface":"ויעבדום","gloss":"wọ́n sì ṣe ìjọsìn fún wọn"},{"surface":"וישתחוו","gloss":"wọ́n sì forí balẹ̀"},{"surface":"להם","gloss":"fún wọn"},{"surface":"ואתי","gloss":"⟨את⟩mi sì"},{"surface":"עזבו","gloss":"fi sílẹ̀"},{"surface":"ואת","gloss":"⟨את⟩"},{"surface":"תורתי","gloss":"òfin mi"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"kò"},{"surface":"שמרו","gloss":"pa mọ́"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-23T02:14:43.852620152Z","model":"glm-5.3"}